### user-service — thử API bằng IntelliJ HTTP Client (nút ▶ cạnh mỗi request)
### hoặc VS Code extension "REST Client". Chạy theo thứ tự từ trên xuống.
### Password test user = SHOP_TEST_USER_PASSWORD trong deploy/.env

@kc = http://keycloak:8180/realms/shop/protocol/openid-connect/token
@api = http://localhost:8081
@password = Dev@12345

### Lấy token admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{kc}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=shop-app&username=admin&password={{password}}

> {% client.global.set("admin", response.body.access_token); %}

### Lấy token support1 (ROLE_SUPPORT: user:read, user:reset-password)
POST {{kc}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=shop-app&username=support1&password={{password}}

> {% client.global.set("support", response.body.access_token); %}

### Lấy token user1 (ROLE_USER: không có quyền quản trị)
POST {{kc}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=shop-app&username=user1&password={{password}}

> {% client.global.set("user", response.body.access_token); %}

### ── Tài khoản của tôi ──────────────────────────────────────

### Profile của user1 (lần đầu: tự tạo bản ghi user_profile)
GET {{api}}/api/account
Authorization: Bearer {{user}}

### Cập nhật profile của user1
PUT {{api}}/api/account
Authorization: Bearer {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phoneNumber": "0912345678", "languageKey": "en" }

### ── Quản trị user ────────────────────────────────────────

### user1 tìm user → 403 (không có user:read)
GET {{api}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{user}}

### support tìm user → 200
GET {{api}}/api/admin/users?keyword=shop.local&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{support}}

### admin tạo user → 201 (temporaryPassword=false để đăng nhập thử được bằng direct grant)
POST {{api}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jane",
  "email": "jane@shop.local",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "0987654321",
  "password": "Jane@12345",
  "temporaryPassword": false,
  "roles": ["ROLE_USER"]
}

> {% client.global.set("janeId", response.body.id); %}

### Chi tiết jane
GET {{api}}/api/admin/users/{{janeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{support}}

### admin sửa jane
PUT {{api}}/api/admin/users/{{janeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "jane@shop.local", "firstName": "Janet", "lastName": "Doe", "enabled": true, "languageKey": "en" }

### support reset mật khẩu jane → 204
POST {{api}}/api/admin/users/{{janeId}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{support}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "Reset@12345", "temporary": false }

### admin gán role SELLER cho jane → token mới của jane có product:write
PUT {{api}}/api/admin/users/{{janeId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roles": ["ROLE_USER", "ROLE_SELLER"] }

### support xóa jane → 403 (không có user:delete)
DELETE {{api}}/api/admin/users/{{janeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{support}}

### admin xóa jane → 204
DELETE {{api}}/api/admin/users/{{janeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
